	ResistanceEffect: Level {0} | +2 defense and +5 seconds per level | {1}
	ProtectionEffect: Level {0} | damage absorption cost falls every 5 levels | {1}
	FlightEffect: Level {0} | +3% flight speed per level | {1}
	TeleportEffect: Level {0} | cost and cooldown decrease with level | {1}
	SenseEffect: Level {0} | Qi consumption becomes less frequent | {1}
